= Introduction =
Much of the warnings and use case instructions from Whonix KVM, such as running the OS [https://www.whonix.org/wiki/KVM#Command_Line_Interface_(CLI) headlessly] or using [https://www.whonix.org/wiki/KVM#Shared_Folder shared folders], are applicable.

For more details about {{project_name_short}}, check [[About|{{project_name_short}} pages]].

Support tickets should be forwarded to the [https://forums.{{project_clearnet}}/c/kvm KVM subforum].

= Install KVM =

For '''{{project_name_short}}''' on Intel / AMD, install:

{{CodeSelect|code=
sudo apt install --no-install-recommends qemu-system-x86 qemu-system-gui qemu-system-modules-spice qemu-utils libvirt-daemon libvirt-daemon-driver-qemu libvirt-daemon-driver-storage libvirt-daemon-driver-nodedev libvirt-clients virt-manager gir1.2-spiceclientgtk-3.0 passt ovmf swtpm swtpm-tools safe-rm xz-utils
}}

For '''{{project_name_short}}''' on PowerPC, install:

{{CodeSelect|code=
sudo apt install --no-install-recommends qemu-system-ppc qemu-system-gui qemu-system-modules-spice qemu-utils libvirt-daemon-system libvirt-daemon-driver-qemu libvirt-daemon-driver-storage libvirt-clients virt-manager gir1.2-spiceclientgtk-3.0 passt swtpm swtpm-tools safe-rm xz-utils
}}

